{"id":10,"jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"content":[{"text":"{\"name\":\"projects/12814261165210836466/screens/dca5a75039a04388b87eef6384b7a1be\",\"title\":\"Cinematic, wide-angle shot of a runner in Jakarta at night or dawn. Motion blur effect to convey speed and energy. The background features subtle Jakarta landmarks with a dark, moody 'void' black atmosphere. Ambient lighting from city lights in the 5 region colors (red, lime, cyan, blue, grey). High resolution, professional sports photography.\",\"screenshot\":{\"name\":\"projects/12814261165210836466/screens/dca5a75039a04388b87eef6384b7a1be/fileEntries/screenshot\",\"downloadUrl\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLs5_jH8N_qkCzWV5r1lxbjhM7REY-mrS-0CJdCzfrcbczLo9ceKWO44pfXzc7cI5X9TpqWogO3Ai4BcQ6bvWsvAVWzWYBQfPqQEuoC0punnIPt8R-yc7gqbiFNxSxgrtG2eYoNlObnGwRHqlZqwpTZliLs2tWVOpZior_LH8fmF-ufx3293NwFKbAT8Z7GbUlH63Ib7QT0YfCpSI0Fri5kD83nXs_RFcJM7kTF7SjLqkvtZLYmlHbEpBuJ_\"},\"htmlCode\":{},\"width\":\"1024\",\"height\":\"1024\"}","type":"text"}],"structuredContent":{"height":"1024","htmlCode":{},"name":"projects/12814261165210836466/screens/dca5a75039a04388b87eef6384b7a1be","screenshot":{"downloadUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLs5_jH8N_qkCzWV5r1lxbjhM7REY-mrS-0CJdCzfrcbczLo9ceKWO44pfXzc7cI5X9TpqWogO3Ai4BcQ6bvWsvAVWzWYBQfPqQEuoC0punnIPt8R-yc7gqbiFNxSxgrtG2eYoNlObnGwRHqlZqwpTZliLs2tWVOpZior_LH8fmF-ufx3293NwFKbAT8Z7GbUlH63Ib7QT0YfCpSI0Fri5kD83nXs_RFcJM7kTF7SjLqkvtZLYmlHbEpBuJ_","name":"projects/12814261165210836466/screens/dca5a75039a04388b87eef6384b7a1be/fileEntries/screenshot"},"title":"Cinematic, wide-angle shot of a runner in Jakarta at night or dawn. Motion blur effect to convey speed and energy. The background features subtle Jakarta landmarks with a dark, moody 'void' black atmosphere. Ambient lighting from city lights in the 5 region colors (red, lime, cyan, blue, grey). High resolution, professional sports photography.","width":"1024"}}}